# ── Auto-generated tracker data (backend is source of truth; DO NOT commit) ──
# These are regenerated every refresh and committing them caused constant 15-min
# push-race merge conflicts. Engines read them from disk if present but fall back
# to the live backend API, so not committing them is safe. (2026-06-30)
